\ S13 probe E — the end-to-end program the cross-call App lift should make pass.
\ Helper with an App-typed pass-through signature, a poly caller doing the
\ cross-call, and a concrete grounding in main (Wrap over i64, intrinsics only).
\ Today: the S1-17.i fence must fire (captured here as the pre-lift golden);
\ post-lift this is the primary green golden candidate.
import: intrinsics * ;

type: Wrap['X] | Wrap 'X ;

: step ['F 'T] ( 'F['T] -- 'F['T] ) ;
: outer ['It 'T] ( 'It['T] -- 'It['T] ) step ;
: main ( -- ) 42 Wrap outer drop ;
